# 换行符统一为 LF：否则 Linux / macOS 贡献者一打开仓库就看到「整个文件都改了」
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不要做换行转换，也不要生成 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 锁文件在 GitHub 上折叠显示，避免 review 时刷屏
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true
